<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">- WolioNT</book>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="rem">Approved by consultant for publication Jan 2025.</para>
  <para style="h">YUNUS</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yun.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yunus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yunus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yunus</para>
  <para style="imt">POGAU BHAA-BHAANA</para>
  <para style="im">Bokuna <char style="bk">Yunus </char> incia sii aposala tee manga bokuna nabii mosagaanana i nuncana Kitabi Momangkilo, roonamo boku incia sii inda akoantoaka kasameana nabii, maka apetulatulaaka tuaapa o dhadhina Nabii Yunus, wakutuuna incia inda aose parintana Aulataʼala. Yunus sii o nabii modhadhina 800 tao wakutuuna Isa Al Masi indapo alaahiri tee i wakutuuna pamarintana Raja Yeroboam ll amembali rajana Israel, tee incia atumpua Aulataʼala to alingka i Kota Niniwe i ibu kotana pamarintana Asyur momembalina bhalina Israel to apaumbaakea ande o kota incia sumai bheatopahancuru. Maka o Yunus amendeu alingka i kota incia sumai to apakawaaka kasameana Aulataʼala, roonamo incia ayaakini ande o miana Niniwe auntomo to apewau dosa, Aulataʼala inda bheapalausaka haejatina to apahancuru kota incia sumai. Sabutuna sapadhana pia angu kajadia inda momentela, Yunus ataʼatimo parintana KAWASANA OPU, maka sapadhana sumai incia asabhamorandana, roonamo Kota Niniwe inda asidha atopahancuru.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tugasina Yunus i nuncana boku incia sii satotuuna to agambaraaka sifatuna manga miana Israel pokaina tee manga mia mominaakana i lipu mosagaanana. Miana Israel atarima kakembana Aulataʼala to ahambaaka manga lipu mosagaanana to amatauaka Aulataʼala sakaro-karona, maka manga incia aabhia ande o lipu mosagaanana amembali musuna tee aharapu mpuu ande o musuna sumai bheapahancurua Aulataʼala. Maka inda soo incia sumai, boku incia sii agambaraaka ande o Aulataʼala Mangamaasiakana tee Mangaʼamponina; ifikirina Aulataʼala salabhina aʼamponi tee apasalaamati saangu lipu tee ahukumu tee apahancurua, moomini o lipu incia sumai o musuna uumatina karona.</para>
  <para style="iot">Antona</para>
  <para style="io1">Nabii Yunus inda aose kakembana Aulataʼala <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Doʼana Nabii Yunus <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 2:1-10">2:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tobaana miana Niniwe <char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 3:1-10">3:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nabii Yunus aʼamara roonamo kalapena incana Aulataʼala tee raʼeatina Niniwe<char style="ior"><ref loc="JON 4:1-11">4:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nabii Yunus Inda Aose Kakembana Aulataʼala</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="JON 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:25">2Raj. 14:25</ref>. </char>
    </note>Saangu wakutuu o KAWASANA OPU afirimani i Yunus bin Amitai mboo sii, <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />"Lingkamo pekadhei i Niniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Niniwe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niniwe sii o ibukotana Asyur, saangu lipu mobharina dosana, amasega, tee apebula (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NAM 1:11">Nah. 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 2:12-13">2:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 3:1">3:1</ref>,<ref loc="NAM 3:4">4</ref>,<ref loc="NAM 3:16">16</ref>,<ref loc="NAM 3:19">19</ref></char>). Miana Yahudi abanci mpuu miana Asyur tee aabhia kabilanga bhalina. Nabii Yunus aʼamara mpuu roonamo raʼeatina Niniwe mencuana siwuluna miana Yahudi. Yunus aharapu mpuu mamudhaakana manga incia bheahukumua Kawasana Opu. </char></note> i kota momaoge sumai to uudhaniaka manga incia, roonamo kumataua o pewauna manga incia amadhaki mpuu."<verse eid="JON 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Maka o Yunus apekadhei alingka aporope i weta i Tarsis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tarsis: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abhari manga ahalii mopogauna ande o Kota Tarsis sii adhaangia i bhiwina tawo i weta i salatana lipu Spanyol. Mboomo imatauna mia bhari, Spanyol sii o karidhona dhaangia pia rewu kilo minaaka i wetana bharana Israel. Maka o Kota Niniwe adhaangia i weta i timbuna tawona Israel. Jadi opea ipewauna Nabii Yunus inda apokana tee opea iparintaakana KAWASANA OPU to incia. </char></note> to apekaridhoaka karona minaaka i KAWASANA OPU. Yunus alingka i Kota Yafo tee iwe sumai dhaangia saangu o kapala bhemobhosena i Tarsis. Sapadhana apomea sewana kapalana, incia akompamo i bhawona kapala sumai kasiimpo abhose to apekaridhoaka karona minaaka i KAWASANA OPU apobhawa-bhawa tee manga mia mobhosena i Tarsis.<verse eid="JON 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Sumaimo KAWASANA OPU aumbaakamo ngalu momakaa mpuu i tawo, kasiimpo atiumbamo garura momaoge, sabutuna o kapala sumai saidhepo amapasa. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Bhari-bharia ana buana kapala uka amaekamo mpuu, kasiimpo manga incia adoʼa tee aemani tulungi i dewana samia-samia. Bhari-bharia barana manga incia abhanakamea i tawo to amagaa-gaaaka o bhawana kapala sumai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 1:5">Maka o Yunus asapomo i tambena kapala, kasiimpo apotidhole tee atokole mpuu iwe sumai. <verse eid="JON 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Wakutuuna anakodana kapala sumai asapo i tambena kapala, incia apokawaakamo Yunus tee apogau, "Tuaapa amembali ingkoo utokole mpuu mboo sii? Bhangumo! Doʼamo i dewamu! Incema amataua o dewamu sumai dhaangiapo mangaudhani tee indaaka tabinasa."<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Manga ana buana kapala sumai apogaumo podho-podho manga incia, "Maimo tabhanakaaka undi to tamatauaka incema mosababuakana ingkita mangakangkanai balaa incia sii." Kasiimpo manga incia abhanakamo undi, tee o Yunus ikangkanaina undi sumai.<verse eid="JON 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Kasiimpo manga incia apogau tee Yunus, "Mangapaumbaakapo, incema buaka moumbaakana balaa sii? Opea o karajaamu tee aminaaka i iapai o asalamu? Iapai o lipumu tee uminaaka i suku i iapai?"<verse eid="JON 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Lawanina Yunus, "Iaku sii o miana Ibrani. Iaku kusomba KAWASANA OPU, Aulataʼala momboorena i sorogaa, mopadhaangiana tawo tee ati."<verse eid="JON 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Sapadhana incia sumai, Yunus apetulatulaakamo ande incia tangasaana apalaiaka karona minaaka i KAWASANA OPU. Sarangona pogauna Yunus, manga ana buana kapala sumai amaekamo mpuu, tee apogau, "Apokia upewau mboo itu?"<verse eid="JON 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Wakutuu incia sumai o tawo ahandamo akogarura tee o ewo amakaa mpuu, sabutuna manga ana buana kapala sumai aabhamo, "Opea tabeana ipewaumami tee ingkoo mamudhaakana o garura sii aunto?"<verse eid="JON 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />Lawanina Yunus, "Tudhaakaakumo i tawo mamudhaakana aunto garura sii, roonamo kumataua ande rampaakanamo iaku iumbaakana garura ogena sii."<verse eid="JON 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />
    <char style="add">Maka o Yunus inda alausaka atudhaakea i tawo. </char> Manga ana buana kapala sumai dhaangiapo aʼusaha to ajao kapalana mamudhaakana ambuli i ati, maka o usahana manga incia asia-sia, roonamo garura sumai ahandamo ajulu o kakaana. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Rampaakanamo sumai, manga incia adoʼamo tee aemani tulungi i KAWASANA OPU, "E KAWASANA OPU, maasangia bholi mangapabinasa rampaakanamo tapekamate mia incia sii, tee bholimo mangapatanggoaka raana mia inda mosala, roonamo Ingkoo KAWASANA OPU padhamo upewau mboomo ipeelumu karomu." <verse eid="JON 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Kasiimpo manga incia aangka Yunus tee atudhaakea i tawo, sabutuna auntomo pamuruna garura sumai. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Manga ana buana kapala sumai amaekamo mpuu tee KAWASANA OPU, sabutuna sasandarana i ati manga incia apasombaakamo kurubani isumbele to KAWASANA OPU tee ajanjiakamo tolauna onina.<verse eid="JON 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mat. 12:40</ref>. </char>
    </note>Wakutuu incia sumai o KAWASANA OPU aparintamo sambaa ikane maoge to adhokuaka Yunus. Sumaimo Yunus ambooremo i nuncana kompona ikane sumai kangengena talu malo talu eo.<verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s1">Doʼana Nabii Yunus</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="JON 2:1-10">2:1-10</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Minaaka i nuncana kompona ikane sumai, Yunus adoʼamo i KAWASANA OPU Aulataʼalana. <verse eid="JON 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />Tee apogau,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JON 2:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">"E KAWASANA OPU, i nuncana kanarakaaku, iaku kugora kuemani tulungi tee Ingkoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">tee Ingkoo ulawaniaku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:2">Iaku kupekee minaaka i nuncana duniana mia mate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">tee urangoa o suaraku.<verse eid="JON 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 42:8">Zab. 42:8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ingkoo padhamo utudhaakaaku i tampa momandala mpuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">i tanga-tangana andala oge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">iwe sumai abulilingiaku solo momakaa mpuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">lolebhatamu tee o ewomu apekalameaku.<verse eid="JON 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />Kasiimpo iaku kupogau, 'Iaku padhamo kutobhanaka minaaka i aroamu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:4">Maka iaku bhekupotonto uka i Bhanuamu momangkilo.'<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />Uwena tawo abulilingiaku, tee bheaala inyawaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:5">andala oge abulilingiaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:5">tee o koncena tawo aburu bhaaku.<verse eid="JON 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Iaku kutondu i tambena kulesena manga gunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">manga kapasona bhambana alamu aopiaku saʼumurua.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:6">Maka o inyawaku upalimbaia minaaka i bhalona koburu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bhalona koburu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana duniana mia mate, apokana tee aeati <char style="xt"><ref loc="JON 2:2">2:2</ref>.</char></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">e KAWASANA OPU, e Aulataʼalaku."<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />"Wakutuuna kufikiria ande o ajalaku bheakawamo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:7">iaku kutoudhanimo tee Ingkoo, e KAWASANA OPU,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:7">tee iaku kuemani doʼa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:7">sakawana i Baitullamu momangkilo."<verse eid="JON 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />"Manga mia mosombana barahala inda mokoguna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:8">amendeu kaasi molagina Aulataʼala momembalina ipotibhaakana manga incia.<verse eid="JON 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Maka iaku bhoasaka kusukuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">tee bhekupasombaakako kurubani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JON 2:9">Iaku bhekupomea opea mopadhana momembalina tolauna oniku.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">Kasalaamati satotuuna minaaka i KAWASANA OPU!"<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Kasiimpo KAWASANA OPU afirimanimo tee ikane sumai, tee o ikane sumai atoluaakamo Yunus i ati.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s1">Tobaana Miana Niniwe</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="JON 3:1-10">3:1-10</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />To kamondona rua mpearo KAWASANA OPU afirimani i Nabii Yunus, pogauna, <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />"Lingkamo pekadhei i Niniwe i kota momaoge sumai, tee upakawaakea to manga raʼeatina o kasamea idhawuakaku to ingkoo sii."<verse eid="JON 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Yunus uka alausakamo alingka i Kota Niniwe mboomo mopadhana ifirimaniakana KAWASANA OPU to incia. Niniwe sii satotuuna saangu kota momaoge mpuu, tee o kaogena kota incia sii mboomo kangengena mia modhalana aena talu eo. <verse eid="JON 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:41">Mat. 12:41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:32">Luk. 11:32</ref>. </char></note> Wakutuuna Yunus apesuaiki kota incia sumai sapadhana adhala ae saeoa, incia apepuumo apakawaaka kasameana Aulataʼala, pogauna, "Pata pulu eopo Kota Niniwe sii bheatopabinasamo!" <verse eid="JON 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Raʼeatina Niniwe sii aparacaeamo mpuu tee kasameana Aulataʼala ipakawaakana Yunus, sabutuna minaaka i kaogesa sakawana i raʼeati biasa apoasamo. Manga incia uka apakemo kae kadhu to tandana asosoakamo bhari-bharia dosana.<verse eid="JON 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Wakutuuna lele incia sumai arangoa rajana Niniwe, raja alausakamo akakaro tee asapo minaaka i kauncuramakana, kasiimpo jubana arambasakea tee o badana abulilingiakea kae kadhu, kasiimpo auncura i bhawona ngawuna rapu. <verse eid="JON 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Sapadhana sumai o rajana Niniwe tee manga kaogesana apalimbamo saangu parinta:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JON 3:7" />
  <para style="pm" vid="JON 3:7">"Malape maanusia atawa o binata kadhambaaka, siitumo gulumana sapi atawa o dumba inda amembali akande opeapo uka, inda amembali akande atawa asumpu uwe. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Maka bhari-bharia maanusia atawa o kadhambaaka tabeana apake kae kadhu, tee bhari-bharia mia tabeana adoʼa tee mpuu-mpuuna incana i Aulataʼala, tee samia-samia tabeana atoba minaaka i pewauna momadhaki tee minaaka i dosa mopadhana ipewauna. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />Tapalaka o Aulataʼala bheabhaliia o haejatina tee indamo aʼamara, sabutuna ingkita inda asidha tabinasa."<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Pewauna manga miana Niniwe sumai akamatea Aulataʼala, ande manga incia atobamo minaaka i manga giu momadhaki sabutuna Aulataʼala apabatalamo haejatina mboomo mopadhana imambotuakana bhaa-bhaana, tee manga incia indamo asidha ahukumua Aulataʼala.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nabii Yunus Aʼamara roonamo Kalapena Incana Aulataʼala tee Raʼeatina Niniwe</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="JON 4:1-11">4:1-11</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Maka o Nabii Yunus amapii incana tee aʼamara mpuu roonamo Aulataʼala inda asidha apabinasa Niniwe. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:6">Limb. 34:6</ref>. </char></note>Kasiimpo incia adoʼa i KAWASANA OPU, pogauna, "E KAWASANA OPU, buaka mencuana giu incia sii mopadhana ipogauakaku wakutuuna iaku dhaangiapo i lipuku? Rampaakanamo sumai, iaku kupalaiaka karoku i Tarsis. Iaku kumataua ande Ingkoo Aulataʼala Mobukeakana Rahumati tee Momaogena Kaasina, inda amasimba uʼamara, molagina kaasina tee Ingkoo sadia mangamaasiaka, sabutuna inda asidha uumbaaka balaa. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" />E KAWASANA OPU, ande amembali uhobutimea o inyawaku, roonamo salabhina kumate tee kudhadhi."<verse eid="JON 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />Maka o KAWASANA OPU afirimani, "Ingkoo inda tee alasamu to uʼamara mboo itu."<verse eid="JON 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Yunus alingkamo minaaka i Kota Niniwe <char style="add">sapadhana apakawaaka Firimanina Aulataʼala i raʼeati</char> tee ambooremo i weta i timbuna kota incia sumai. Iwe sumai incia apakaro saangu wale to apeuluaka i nuncana, tee aantagi opea bhemomembalina tee Kota Niniwe sumai.<verse eid="JON 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Kasiimpo KAWASANA OPU Aulataʼala apatuwu saangu puuna penembula mopapeuluna bhaana Yunus to apauntoaka kasabhanarandana. Yunus akaunde-unde mpuu roonamo penembula incia sumai. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Maka samainawana tee dhaangiapo raneeo, Aulataʼala aumbaakamo ulo-ulo to apapaki tee abhaloki bhatana penembula sumai sakawana amalau. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Sapadhana incia sumai tee sabhetena matana eo, Aulataʼala aumbaakamo uka ngalu momasodho mominaakana i timbu tee mokangkanaina tee mopekapiina bhaana Yunus, sabutuna incia amalutemo tee saidhepo amalimpu, roonamo bhaana akangkanaia kilana matana eo. Pogauna, "Salabhina kumate tee kudhadhi mboo sii!"<verse eid="JON 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Maka o Aulataʼala afirimani Yunus, "Ingkoo inda tee alasamu to uʼamara mboo itu roonamo penembula incia sumai!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 4:9">Lawanina, "Iaku kulaenga kuʼamara, tee o amaraku sii kubhawea sakawana kumate!"<verse eid="JON 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />Maka o KAWASANA OPU afirimani uka, "Ingkoo umaasiaka penembula sumai, garaaka moomini saidhe inda umanguleakea, tee inda udhambaakea. Penembula sumai atuwu kangengena samalomea, tee o matena samalo uka. <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />Inda amungki Iaku inda kumaasiaka Niniwe o kota momaoge mokoraʼeatina alabhi minaaka i 120.000 mia inda momatauna mopaposalana lima kaai tee kaanana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">inda momatauna mopaposalana lima kaai tee kaanana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibarati incia sii amembali akomaʼana mia inda momatauna mopaposalana giu mosala tee giu mobanara. Atawa amembali uka akomaʼana o anaana momaidhiidhii.</char></note> tee mobharina kadhambaakana sumai!"<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>